  "details": "It seems the new \"Live Now\" page is not displaying the correct or anticipated number for all the friends I can join, it's much less than anticipated. I counted my social tab and found more than 11 joinable instances with friends.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Have lots of friends online? (97 friends online, 33 friends locations in social tab)\n\n2. Compare the numbers from Social tab and Quick Menu launchpad to Live Now.\n\nExpected result: Approximately \"33 friends you can join\" (or 37).\n\nActual result: \"11 friends you can join\".\n\n(Please ignore the `Steam Beta Branch: default` weirdness in the logs, this is `VRChat Build: 2026.4.2-1948-2b94e366a5-Release` launched from a different directory while a non-beta client is installed and running in the Steam directory.)",
